 materially affect results; do not treat model backends as additional coding-agent adapters.","limitations","源码提供的内容","Verified Python solve/judge/record pipeline, container/egress code, and separate claude_code.py, codex.py, and opencode.py adapters. The public GameLogicBench-Tasks repository is a separate dependency and contains the game/task/judge/reference content.","codeScope","代码类型","实现代码","codeType","links","参考资料","items",[85],"evidenceUrl",{"_54":81,"_25":86},"https://github.com/NJU-LINK/GameLogicBench/blob/main/docs/running.md","代码与使用说明",[90],"codeUrl",{"_54":87,"_25":91},"https://github.com/NJU-LINK/GameLogicBench/tree/main/geb","主要来源",[95],"sourceUrl",{"_54":92,"_25":96},"https://github.com/NJU-LINK/GameLogicBench","引擎与运行环境","Godot","engine","list","客户端与模型归属","ordered",false,[106,107,108],"agents","Claude Code","Codex","OpenCode","工具类别","开发评估","lead","summary","evaluation",[116,117,118],"implementation","claude-code","codex","opencode",{"_120":121},"documents",{"_63":122,"_35":123},[125,129,130,131,128,132,133,134,135,136,137,138,139,140,141,142,143,144,145,146,147,148,149,150,151,152,153,154,155,156,157,158,159,160,161,162,163,127,164,126,165,166,167,168,169,170,171,172,173,174,175,176,177,178,179,180,181,182],[124,125,126,127,128],"reading-guide","practical-guide","level-design-skill","deployment","publishing-platforms","tutorials-and-demos","coding-agent-game-code","game-testing-library","agents-notes","engines-notes","game-ai-notes","cadle-repositories","world-model-notes","research-index","production-research-notes","engine-operation-contracts","production-work-orders","studio-production-case-studies","native-operation-details","production-debugging-contracts","production-coverage-gaps","generative-tools-research","generative-api-boundaries","generation-delivery-contracts","asset-validation-contracts","asset-selection-feedback","visual-evidence-research","visual-feedback-mechanisms","game-development-evaluation","benchmark-reproducibility","gameplay-